DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel/{tunnel_id}
Permanently deletes a Cloudflare Tunnel from an account. The tunnel must have no active connections.
Required: account_id (path); tunnel_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel/{tunnel_id}
Fetches a single Cloudflare Tunnel.
Required: account_id (path); tunnel_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel/{tunnel_id}/connectors/{connector_id}
Retrieves a connector and its connection details for a Cloudflare Tunnel, including its cloudflared version, architecture, and connected Cloudflare locations.
Required: account_id (path); tunnel_id (path); connector_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cfd_tunnel/{tunnel_id}
Updates the name or secret of an existing Cloudflare Tunnel.
Required: tunnel_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
